<title>BOTSWANA: WOMEN TAKE TOP JOBS AT BOTSWANA CENTRAL BANK.</title>
<headline>WOMEN TAKE TOP JOBS AT BOTSWANA CENTRAL BANK.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Botswana said on Monday it had appointed Linah Mohohlo as its second deputy governor.</p>
<p>The post was created in recent amendments to the Bank of Botswana Act.</p>
<p>Mohohlo's appointment from January 1 means that all senior executive positions in the central bank, except for the governor, are held by women.</p>
<p>The bank's deputy governor is Julia Majaha-Jartby and the post of general manager is held by Nozipho Mabe.</p>
</text>
